{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117320","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117320/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117320/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117320/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117320","id":4057531398,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7JrGX3","number":117320,"title":"Fix change dock layout caused missing debugger for EditorDebuggerSession","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-03-11T11:05:24Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T23:26:06Z","closed_at":"2026-04-01T18:59:02Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117320","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117320","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117320.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117320.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117243\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nWhen we changed layout of editor, e.g. move `EditorDebuggerPlugin` from default position to bottom. It will first remove from original position, then add to target position.\r\n\r\nThe remove child operation will trigger a `tree_exited` signal, which connected to `_debugger_gone_away()`.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d103efb6ea076ec52b4deca358e83f1fd177d163/editor/debugger/editor_debugger_plugin.cpp#L118\r\n\r\nIt will set debugger to nullptr in `_debugger_gone_away()`, then cause `Plugin is not attached to debugger` at the next operation.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nWe can observe `NOTIFICATION_POST_ENTER_TREE` to atttach debugger for relevant `EditorDebuggerSession`  to fix missing debugger issue while changing layout.\r\n\r\n[debugger-error.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d18372b-3896-4752-bc16-4c26cde76503)\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117320/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117320/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}